            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Optional/mandatory</td><td>Critical/non-critical</td><td>Meaning of the designation expected behavior of the relying party</td></tr><tr><td>x</td><td>c</td><td>Required/mandatory extension that is processed. The CA generating the certificate includes this extension in the certificate. The relying party processes this extension in the certificate.One and only one (1) of the following behaviors are expected:  - if the extension is not present the relying party will reject the certificate;  OR  - if the extension is present but the relying party/validating entity is unable to process it, the relying party will reject the certificate;  OR  - if the extension is present and the relying party/validating entity is able to process it, the relying party will process the data and make a determination on certificate acceptance/rejection based on the data in the extension and the requirements as specified by this document.</td></tr></table>",
